WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:09.414
Namaste!

2
00:00:09.454 --> 00:00:13.415
Medoro Pharmacy ke is tutorial mein aapka swagat
hai.

3
00:00:13.455 --> 00:00:18.775
Is part mein hum dekhenge ki Medoro par apna
account kaise banate hain,

4
00:00:18.815 --> 00:00:23.002
use verify kaise karte hain, aur login kaise
karte hain.

5
00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:27.037
Sabse pehle browser mein medoro.in kholiye.

6
00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:30.184
Upar menu mein Pharmacy par click kijiye.

7
00:00:30.954 --> 00:00:34.671
Yahan Medoro Pharmacy ke saare features, pricing

8
00:00:34.711 --> 00:00:41.403
aur data security ki jaankari hai: billing,
inventory, GST, accounts aur AI assistant.

9
00:00:44.578 --> 00:00:49.670
Ab upar daayin taraf 'Start 7-day free trial'
button par click kijiye.

10
00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:54.509
Saat din ka trial bilkul free hai, aur koi card
nahi maanga jaata.

11
00:00:55.268 --> 00:00:57.082
Yeh asli sign-up page hai.

12
00:00:57.122 --> 00:01:01.573
Yahan aap Google account se ya email se sign up
kar sakte hain.

13
00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:07.746
Dhyan dijiye: is video ke liye hum ek alag demo
server istemaal kar rahe hain,

14
00:01:07.786 --> 00:01:11.095
taaki kisi asli pharmacy ka data na chhua jaaye.

15
00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:15.352
Demo server par Medoro ka bilkul yahi software
chal raha hai,

16
00:01:15.392 --> 00:01:17.864
aur ismein saara data kaalpanik hai.

17
00:01:18.612 --> 00:01:23.552
Email se sign up karne ke liye apna email
address daaliye aur 'Send code' dabaaiye.

18
00:01:24.328 --> 00:01:28.944
Medoro aapke email par chhah ankon ka
verification code bhejta hai,

19
00:01:28.984 --> 00:01:31.307
jo das minute tak valid rehta hai.

20
00:01:31.347 --> 00:01:36.936
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, aur
'Confirm and continue' par click kijiye.

21
00:01:37.702 --> 00:01:39.308
Email confirm ho gaya!

22
00:01:39.348 --> 00:01:43.349
Ab pharmacy ki details bharne wala form khul
gaya hai.

23
00:01:43.389 --> 00:01:47.540
Yeh onboarding hum agle part mein step by step
bharenge.

24
00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:54.348
Ab dekhte hain ki login aur account ki suraksha
kaise kaam karti hai.

25
00:01:54.388 --> 00:01:56.425
Pehle hum sign out karte hain.

26
00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:00.291
Sign in page par apna email aur password
daaliye.

27
00:02:06.899 --> 00:02:11.528
Owner aur manager ke account par two-step
verification zaroori hai.

28
00:02:11.568 --> 00:02:15.778
Authenticator app mein dikh raha chhah ankon ka
code daaliye.

29
00:02:15.818 --> 00:02:20.517
Agar phone paas na ho, to recovery code bhi
istemaal kar sakte hain.

30
00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:24.976
Apne counter PC ko tees din ke liye trusted bhi
bana sakte hain.

31
00:02:25.731 --> 00:02:27.496
Bas, aap andar aa gaye.

32
00:02:27.536 --> 00:02:31.105
Ab password bhool jaane ki sthiti dekhte hain.

33
00:02:31.145 --> 00:02:35.028
Sign out karke 'Forgot password' par click
kijiye.

34
00:02:35.777 --> 00:02:39.611
Apna registered email daaliye aur 'Send code'
dabaaiye.

35
00:02:39.651 --> 00:02:43.625
Medoro us email par chhah ankon ka reset code
bhejta hai,

36
00:02:43.665 --> 00:02:46.301
jo pandrah minute tak valid rehta hai.

37
00:02:47.044 --> 00:02:52.025
Email se code dekhkar yahan daaliye, phir naya
password do baar likhiye.

38
00:02:52.065 --> 00:02:57.256
Dhyan dijiye: password badalte hi aap har device
se sign out ho jaate hain,

39
00:02:57.296 --> 00:03:01.510
aur login par two-step verification phir bhi
laagu rehta hai.

40
00:03:02.823 --> 00:03:04.178
Password badal gaya.

41
00:03:04.218 --> 00:03:08.990
Ab naye password aur authenticator code se
dobara sign in karte hain.

42
00:03:19.974 --> 00:03:25.094
Security ke liye yaad rakhiye: password kam se
kam das characters ka rakhiye,

43
00:03:25.134 --> 00:03:27.976
recovery codes offline sambhaalkar rakhiye,

44
00:03:28.016 --> 00:03:33.672
aur paanch baar galat password daalne par
account kuch der ke liye lock ho jaata hai.

45
00:03:33.712 --> 00:03:36.353
Medoro mein koi default login nahi hota.
